          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " these",
          "start": 628.72,
          "end": 629.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " verses",
          "start": 629.5,
          "end": 629.98,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " in",
          "start": 629.98,
          "end": 630.22,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " this",
          "start": 630.22,
          "end": 630.34,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " particular",
          "start": 630.34,
          "end": 630.82,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Sura.",
          "start": 630.82,
          "end": 631.72,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And you know something? I do go along with them. I say \"okay, what the messenger gives you, take, and what he forbids you, don't take.",
