    {
      "text": "[59:10]  As for the immigrants who came later to Islam, they say, \"Our Lord, forgive us and forgive those who preceded us to Islam, remove from our hearts any hatred toward the believers. Our Lord, You are the Compassionate, Most Merciful.\"",
